0..47 Comment "//! A seat\'s protocol run between two endpoints"
48..143 Comment "//! [Honda-1998-language_primitives_type_discipline_structured_communicationbased_programming]:"
144..221 Comment "//! `fork` opens a channel at the seat\'s session type, the forked side serves"
222..298 Comment "//! it, and the desk drives its dual through every branch the seat may take."
